      "titleHtml": null,
      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai31/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000110001.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ああ、<u><ruby>疲<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた</u>。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">A, mệt quá.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">じゃ、どこかで <u><ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し <ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もう</u>。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vậy thì nghỉ ở đâu chút đi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">あの <ruby>喫茶店<rp>(</rp><rt>きっさてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない？</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vào quán nước kia không?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">うん、そうしよう。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ừ, vậy đi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai31_rsc1_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> おなかが すきました</p> <p> <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>か <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べます</p> <p> <span>2)</span><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai31_rsc1_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> のどが かわきました</p> <p> ジュースでも <ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みます</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 2</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai31/renshuuC-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000110010.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u><ruby>発表<rp>(</rp><rt>はっぴょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></u>の <ruby>準備<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅんび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は できましたか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Việc chuẩn bị phát biểu đã hoàn thành chưa?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">えーと、まだ ②<u><ruby>資料<rp>(</rp><rt>しりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を コピーして</u> いません。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">À, vẫn chưa copy.</div></div></div><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">これから ②<u>コピーしよう</u>と <ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っています。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi định copy giờ.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">わかりました。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi hiểu rồi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p><p> ② <ruby>会議室<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>予約<rp>(</rp><rt>よやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します</p><p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>出張<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p><p> ② <ruby>本社<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>書類<rp>(</rp><rt>しょるい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 3</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai31/renshuuC-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000110011.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u><ruby>夏休<rp>(</rp><rt>なつやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み</u>は <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>か <ruby>予定<rp>(</rp><rt>よてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありますか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Kỳ nghĩ hè có dự định gì đó không?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">②<u><ruby>北海道<rp>(</rp><rt>ほっかいどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する</u> つもりです。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Dự định đi du lịch Hokkaido.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">いいですね。どのくらいですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tốt nhỉ. Đi tầm bao lâu?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">③<u><ruby>10日<rp>(</rp><rt>とおか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></u>の <ruby>予定<rp>(</rp><rt>よてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tầm 10 ngày.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>冬休<rp>(</rp><rt>ふゆやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み</p><p> ② <ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります</p><p> ③ 2<ruby>週間<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>春休<rp>(</rp><rt>はるやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み</p><p> ② <ruby>沖縄<rp>(</rp><rt>おきなわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます</p><p> ③ <ruby>5日<rp>(</rp><rt>いつか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぐらい</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <br /> <?php $de_stt = \"31\"; ?><div class=\"vnjp-ad-slot vnjp-ad-before_share\" data-slot=\"before_share\" data-vnjp-collapse=\"1\" style=\"min-height:280px\"><div class=\"vnjp-ad-inner\"><!-- Geniee InPage --> <div id=\"div-gpt-ad-1786536859455-0\"> </div></div></div>",
